From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cryolitia PukNgae <cryolitia@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Nov 2026 04:09:54 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] users: Wait for fingerprint verification to stop before
 enrolling

fprintd keeps the verification action until VerifyStop completes. Defer EnrollStart until the stop reply, including when the dialog is already stopping a completed verification. Drop the pending enrollment on cancellation, close or loss of the reader.

Generated-by: LLM
---
 panels/system/users/cc-fingerprint-dialog.c | 112 ++++++++++++++------
 1 file changed, 80 insertions(+), 32 deletions(-)

